* official Analog Canvas netlist; PDK X cards rewritten by convert.py
.model nch nmos
.model pch pmos

.subckt dut VDD VSS VB2 VREF VB1 IBUF VB4 VIN VOUT
CL VOUT net12 1p
M1 VBN VBN net1 VSS nch l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
